&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of building and influencing relationships with C-level stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated use of AI tools (e.g., generative AI, sales intelligence platforms, predictive analytics) to enhance account planning, territory strategy, and pipeline generation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
