&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5054&quot; data-local-id=&quot;15844e70e97e&quot;&gt;Experience with agentic workloads, including tool calling, structured outputs, streaming APIs, high concurrency, and multi-step orchestration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5200&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7cd4bee1cb99&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;CUDA&lt;/span&gt; or Triton familiarity, even if the role is not primarily a kernel-engineering role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5292&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f030cb084e2a&quot;&gt;Open-source contributions to vLLM, SGLang, TensorRT-LLM, FlashInfer, LMCache, PyTorch, Triton, Ray, KServe, or related projects.&lt;/p&gt;
