&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong judgment, discretion, and confidence in high-profile or fast-moving situations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
