&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Realize your potential by joining the leading performance-driven advertising company!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Content Marketing Manager on the Marketing team in our London office, you will&amp;nbsp;take ownership of key content initiatives, craft our product narrative, and protect our brand tone of voice across global touchpoints.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting directly to the Head of Global Brand and Marketing Communications, you will serve as the central content strategist and owner for our flagship products. As an Individual Contributor (IC), you will leverage strong cross functional relationships&amp;nbsp; partnering closely with writers, designers, web managers, social media leads, and customer engagement teams to deliver high impact, conversion focused content campaigns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To thrive in this role, you’ll need:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in content marketing within a B2B SaaS or technology environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High comfort level working as a hands on, high impact Individual Contributor (IC) who drives alignment across matrixed teams without needing direct reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To be based in the UK and willing to work on a hybrid schedule (3 days in office per week).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in crafting high level product messaging frameworks, long form hero content, and conversion driven microcopy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills with demonstrated ability to manage creative agencies, external vendors, and cross departmental teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with digital content metrics, web analytics, and campaign measurement tools to optimize content based on data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience and qualifcations in Editing / Journalism / Writing&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the AdTech industry&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll make an impact:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Content Marketing Manager, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product Messaging &amp;amp; Positioning: Own core messaging frameworks for leading products, translating complex value propositions into clear, compelling stories across all customer lifecycle stages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brand Tone of Voice &amp;amp; Microcopy: Serve as the custodian of our Brand Tone of Voice. Write and refine microcopy across website UI, landing pages, CTAs, and email touchpoints to elevate user experience and drive conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Campaign &amp;amp; Project Ownership&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; End to end ownership of major content marketing projects&amp;nbsp; from strategy and brief creation to cross functional alignment, execution, and performance measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross Functional Collaboration: Partner closely with internal content writers, designers, web managers, social media, and customer engagement teams to execute cohesive, multi channel content strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vendor &amp;amp; Agency Management: Lead relationships with external agencies, freelance writers, and external vendors to scale content output while ensuring high standards of brand quality and tone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance Analysis: Monitor content KPIs and analytics to evaluate messaging impact, optimizing distribution and content performance over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Taboola?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you ask Taboolars what they love about working here, they’ll tell you that they’ve been empowered to realize their full potential while growing and learning from and with smart and talented people. They’ll also share more about:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adam Singolda, Taboola Founder and CEO says; “You can copy anything from another business but you can’t copy a company’s culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Well-being:&lt;/strong&gt; With an office culture that’s international, social and supportive, Taboola offers very generous benefits including 25 days holiday, excellent health insurance, some flexible working, free breakfast and lunch every day, stock options and Perkbox to name just a few.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility: &lt;/strong&gt;We offer a hybrid work schedule with 3 days in-office with an option to come in more often if desired.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with some of the biggest names: &lt;/strong&gt;Our publisher partners include Yahoo, Conde Nast, Fox Sports, NBCU, ESPN, CBS, and E! Online. Our advertiser clients include Wells Fargo, Honda, Pinterest, Expedia and Honda.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to realize your potential?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Taboola is an equal opportunity employer and we value diversity in all forms. We are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees and believe such an environment is critical for success. Employment is decided on the basis of qualifications, merit, and business need.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more about #TaboolaLife on&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/search/results/all/?fetchDeterministicClustersOnly=true&amp;amp;heroEntityKey=urn%3Ali%3Aorganization%3A128707&amp;amp;keywords=taboola&amp;amp;origin=RICH_QUERY_SUGGESTION&amp;amp;position=2&amp;amp;searchId=dcc8bfbb-b05c-458e-a7f1-726d30e7dd80&amp;amp;sid=9(y&amp;amp;spellCorrectionEnabled=false&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/taboola/&quot;&gt; Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/taboola.israel/?hl=en&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1BctKkw2Vj_EOjvy24kjRKq_ZxZzmZxweIqNLQgsLtcs/edit?tab=t.0&quot;&gt; X&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6W0hdStO0jRVYhg4ABzjRw&quot;&gt; YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, &amp;amp; the&lt;a href=&quot;https://bit.ly/41kidx9&quot;&gt; Taboola Life Blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Taboola&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Taboola empowers businesses to grow through performance advertising technology that goes beyond search and social and delivers measurable outcomes at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Taboola works with thousands of businesses who advertise directly on Realize, Taboola’s powerful ad platform, reaching approximately 600M daily active users across some of the best publishers in the world. Publishers like NBC News, Yahoo, and OEMs such as Samsung, Xiaomi and others use Taboola’s technology to grow audience and revenue, enabling Realize to offer unique data, specialized algorithms, and unmatched scale.&lt;/p&gt;
